{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>網上流傳一段車Cam片段，直擊一名身穿黑衫黑褲的男子，竟在機場路往機場方向的路肩上獨自跑步，身旁不斷有車輛駛過，樓主隨即發文：「渣馬就到，練跑還練跑，唔好累人，痴X線！」</p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-22-16h26m24s865.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026raRyVbyCLF1792657882.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p>影片隨即引爆網民熱烈討論，大部分人均指該男子的行為極欠安全意識兼累人累物，不少網民直言「大把地方練跑啦！」，並反問「出事邊個責任？」亦有網民調侃笑問「吸住廢氣跑好啲？」，更有網民對其路線表示震驚，好奇發問：「佢邊度開始跑入機場？」。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T09:22:53.457937+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T09:58:13.597171+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T09:17:55.280086+00:00","content_hash":"fdfebb603c969dc04f000911e46be6c95544f96133b80f555508ff700ff1bbb9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}